Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

They are vendored because ROS 2 Kilted / Rolling install the compiled statistics
types in libfastdds but ship neither their headers nor fastddsgen. This directory is
used when building against Fast DDS 3.x; ../fastdds_statistics_types/ is the 2.14
(Jazzy) counterpart. Replace it when targeting another Fast DDS 3 version.
